n":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-31T16:14:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T17:51:14Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T17:51:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439]\n\n### System information\n\nFedora Linux 43 (Toolbx Container Image)\n\n### Issue description\n\nC# Android Release export APK files includes unnecessary and large debug and static libraries and Windows specific DLLs which bloats the final APK size to 96.8 MiB (161.6 MiB Unpacked).\n\nThese are some of the libraries: \n<img width=\"455\" height=\"365\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52a60d90-0193-4af9-a0dd-a04f5baf5417\" />\n\nI dont think those debug .so and the static libraries (.a) files are necessary in the final APK.\n\nThe export also packs some Windows specific DLLs in `assets/.godot/mono/publish/` which are not huge but still there\n\n<img width=\"443\" height=\"322\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ef45a10-dd38-4a02-b745-96619dceef5d\" />\n\nIt looks like the dotnet publish is giving these files that are simply packed into the APK.\nBy removing those I was able to **reduce the apk files size to ~31mb.** \n\nCurrently I am using the .csproj for partial trimming (I dont know if it would affect the stability) and removal of those libraries so is there any better way to handle this?\n\n```csproj\n    <PropertyGroup Condition=\" '$(GodotTargetPlatform)' == 'android' And '$(Configuration)' == 'ExportRelease' \">\n\t\t<PublishTrimmed>true</PublishTrimmed>\n\t\t<TrimMode>partial</TrimMode>\n\t\t<DebuggerSupport>false</DebuggerSupport>\n\t</PropertyGroup>\n\n\t<Target Name=\"RemoveAndroidBloat\" AfterTargets=\"Publish\"\n\t\t\tCondition=\" '$(GodotTargetPlatform)' == 'android' And '$(Configuration)' == 'ExportRelease' \">\n\t\t<ItemGroup>\n\t\t  <BloatFiles Include=\"$(PublishDir)\\**\\*.a\" />\n\t\t  <BloatFiles Include=\"$(PublishDir)\\**\\libmono-component-debugger.so\" />\n\t\t  <BloatFiles Include=\"$(PublishDir)\\**\\libmono-component-diagnostics_tracing.so\" />\n\t\t  <BloatFiles Include=\"$(PublishDir)\\**\\libmono-component-hot_reload.so\" />\n\t\t</ItemGroup>\n\t\t<Delete Files=\"@(BloatFiles)\" />\n\t</Target>\n        <ItemGroup>\n           <TrimmerRootAssembly Include=\"GodotSharp\" />\n           <TrimmerRootAssembly Include=\"$(TargetName)\" />\n        </ItemGroup>\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a New Project in Godot .Net version\n- Project > Tools> C#> Create C# solution\n- Export > Add > Android\n- Add keystore + alias + password\n- Turn off Include Debug Symbols\n- Export Project with \"Export with Debug\" off\n- Check the generated APK\n\nOR\n\n- Open the Minimal reproduction project ZIP and just export \n- Keystore is in project root and alias and password is mentioned in the README.md\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24983730/MRP.zip)\nKeystore is included in the zip","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115679/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}